People with big boobs often 
suffer from stiff shoulders.

00:14:51.040 --> 00:14:52.200
Did you not know that?

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.450
That Was All I Ever Wanted

00:14:52.200 --> 00:14:54.450
That's not what I asked.

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:57.850
They're so tensed up. I can barely move them.

00:14:57.850 --> 00:15:02.000
I guess I have no choice but to make 
your bed my final resting place.

00:15:02.380 --> 00:15:05.560
Rolly-rolly, rolly-rolly, 
rolly-rolly, rolly-rolly...

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:07.210
Okay, I give.

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:11.220
Seikaisha

00:15:07.210 --> 00:15:11.220
MSRP: 1350 yen Total (Before Tax)

00:15:07.580 --> 00:15:11.220
I'll rub your shoulders, so quit rubbing 
your scent all over my bed, would you?

00:15:14.820 --> 00:15:17.600
Please... be gentle with me.

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:22.220
That's it...

00:15:22.650 --> 00:15:24.510
Keep going just like that...

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:24.900
Okay, what are you playing at?

00:15:25.430 --> 00:15:27.400
I'm acting out that light novel trope

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.880
where the characters seem 
to be doing something raunchy,

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:32.170
but they're not actually.

00:15:32.170 --> 00:15:34.870
That doesn't happen in real life.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.120
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:40.240
H-Hey! Too much! That's too hard, Mizuto-kun!

00:15:40.240 --> 00:15:41.210
Ow, ow, ow! Yeowch!

00:15:41.210 --> 00:15:43.120
Just how close <i>are</i> you two?

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:45.360
You're toying with me, aren't you?

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.130
You've been dating all along, haven't you?!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:50.660
What? But we've always been this way.

00:15:51.290 --> 00:15:53.200
Yeah, haven't we always been like this?

00:15:53.590 --> 00:15:55.290
Oh, I've got it!

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:58.200
Neither of you have ever had friends,

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:01.000
so you have no concept 
of personal boundaries!

00:16:01.000 --> 00:16:02.600
Mystery solved.

00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:04.160
That's rude.

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.920
We've had at least one 
or two friends, you know?

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:09.660
She's right. At least one or two.

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:15.370
Well, everyone has different 
personal boundaries, right?

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:18.550
Exactly. Friendship looks 
different for everyone.

00:16:19.080 --> 00:16:21.240
I-In any case...

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:23.330
Just stop getting touchy-feely on the bed.

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:24.760
Goodness me.

00:16:24.760 --> 00:16:28.960
It must be hard dealing with such a 
possessive little sister, Mizuto-kun.

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:30.540
Yeah, it's a real pain.

00:16:30.540 --> 00:16:32.700
I'm not possessive, 
and I'm not his <i>little</i> sister!

00:16:32.700 --> 00:16:34.340
Well, anyways...

00:16:34.820 --> 00:16:37.930
Could you put my socks on for me, Mizuto-kun?

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:38.890
Yeah, yeah.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:39.930
Hold it!

00:16:39.930 --> 00:16:42.100
Why can't you put your socks on yourself?

00:16:42.100 --> 00:16:44.490
Well, about that...

00:16:44.490 --> 00:16:47.310
Bending over is such a struggle 
when you have big boobs, you know?

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:49.610
Why does it always come back to your breasts?

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.440
Well, to tell the truth,

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:55.770
I've just become accustomed to having 
him take care of me, you know?

00:16:56.240 --> 00:16:58.360
All right, I put them on for you.

00:16:58.360 --> 00:17:00.240
Thank you very much.

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:02.940
Oh, where's your bathroom?

00:17:00.240 --> 00:17:04.710
<b>The Melancholy of 
Haruhi Suzumiya
 Nagaru Tanigawa</b>

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.710
I-I'll show you!

00:17:07.650 --> 00:17:11.710
So do you still have feelings for 
him after all, Higashira-san?

00:17:11.710 --> 00:17:13.090
Of course I do.

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:21.930
The possibility of dating him wasn't 
why I liked him in the first place.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:25.500
I don't think I'll ever stop 
liking him, for that matter.

00:17:25.500 --> 00:17:27.560
As a friend or as a boy.

00:17:27.930 --> 00:17:30.570
Isn't that... hard for you?

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:32.190
I wonder...

00:17:32.190 --> 00:17:35.980
I think I'd find it hard to adjust 
if he got a girlfriend.

00:17:35.980 --> 00:17:41.950
But when I think about it, I'm sure I'd 
be more jealous if he made a new friend.

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:42.540
Huh?

00:17:42.540 --> 00:17:46.540
I'm the one Mizuto-kun 
enjoys talking to the most.

00:17:47.840 --> 00:17:51.520
It's like some territorial instinct 
starts to well up inside me.

00:17:51.520 --> 00:17:53.740
Wouldn't you feel the same, Yume-san?

00:17:53.740 --> 00:18:00.460
How would you feel if some long-lost sister 
walked into his life out of the blue?

00:18:00.460 --> 00:18:01.820
Well...

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:03.560
I'm afraid.

00:18:04.120 --> 00:18:07.030
Mizuto-kun is the only friend I have.

00:18:07.520 --> 00:18:11.630
If he suddenly got more friends who 
filled the same role, I'd just...

00:18:13.430 --> 00:18:17.200
<i>It's not that she wants him all to herself.</i>

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:21.990
<i>She just can't bear the thought of 
losing her unique place in his heart.</i>

00:18:23.260 --> 00:18:24.990
Higashira-san.

00:18:24.990 --> 00:18:27.500
Aren't I your friend too?

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.420
Y-You are?

00:18:31.420 --> 00:18:32.490
Of course.

00:18:32.490 --> 00:18:35.060
B-But still...

00:18:36.560 --> 00:18:39.840
You wouldn't fill the same role as Mizuto-kun.

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:41.720
Yeah, I know.

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:46.020
<i>Probably as much as you do, if not more.</i>

00:18:46.720 --> 00:18:50.690
So... where's the bathroom?

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.390
Have you been doing this stuff all along?

00:18:55.390 --> 00:18:57.820
Rubbing her shoulders and 
putting her socks on for her?

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:01.320
That Was All I Ever Wanted

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:01.320
Well, only because it's her.

00:19:13.110 --> 00:19:13.990
Hey.

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.960
That Was All I Ever Wanted

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:17.960
Put them back on.

00:19:19.940 --> 00:19:21.820
You're really making this a competition?

00:19:21.820 --> 00:19:22.880
Shut it!

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:26.470
It just seemed fun
 to treat you like a servant.

00:19:26.800 --> 00:19:28.730
Put. Them. Back. On.

00:19:28.730 --> 00:19:30.730
That Was All I Ever Wanted

00:19:51.200 --> 00:19:53.450
Y-You heard nothing.

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:00.340
August 15th (Sat)

00:19:56.840 --> 00:20:00.340
Higashira Isana

00:20:08.510 --> 00:20:11.080
Man, thanks for saving me back there.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.480
They kept bombarding me with questions.

00:20:13.480 --> 00:20:16.610
I have no idea how to act in 
front of adults I've never met.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:18.350
Oh, that reminds me.

00:20:18.350 --> 00:20:22.460
Your parents were under the impression 
that I was your ex-girlfriend.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:23.610
Any idea why?

00:20:23.960 --> 00:20:24.680
Huh?

00:20:24.680 --> 00:20:25.900
How'd that come up?

00:20:25.900 --> 00:20:28.380
Well, they asked me if we were dating,

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:31.640
so I told them you'd turned me down a 
while back and that we're just friends now.

00:20:31.640 --> 00:20:33.870
So suddenly, I was your ex.

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:38.150
Listen, they're gonna misunderstand 
if you word it like that.

00:20:39.360 --> 00:20:43.400
Well, I couldn't just say it, you know?

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:45.640
I couldn't handle explaining

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:50.310
that you'd said no when I confessed,
and that we'd never really dated.

00:20:51.540 --> 00:20:57.050
Mizuto-kun... I still haven't fully 
recovered from that, you know?

00:20:57.050 --> 00:20:58.310
I see.

00:20:59.360 --> 00:21:02.940
So don't forget to console 
me whenever you can, okay?

00:21:06.500 --> 00:21:07.880
You're right.

00:21:09.000 --> 00:21:14.560
Staying home and reading books all day 
is a nice way to spend the weekend, huh?

00:21:14.560 --> 00:21:15.400
Yeah.

00:21:17.100 --> 00:21:23.170
<i>I'm sure the time I spent silently 
reading books with Ayai Yume</i>

00:21:17.380 --> 00:21:23.170
<b>Mystery Novels</b>

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:27.180
<i>was just as much fun as today was.</i>

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:30.500
You know, Mizuto...

00:21:31.180 --> 00:21:33.300
You're a good friend.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:37.190
<i>So if we'd never dated...</i>

00:21:39.470 --> 00:21:41.300
Well then, I shall take my leave.

00:21:44.480 --> 00:21:47.200
<i>If we'd never gotten together...</i>

00:21:48.040 --> 00:21:51.050
<i>If we had just stayed 
moderately close friends...</i>

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:56.710
<i>I wonder if we'd still be spending 
time together like we did back then.</i>

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:00.030
<i>But hypothesizing about it's pointless.</i>

00:22:00.030 --> 00:22:01.210
<i>Neither she nor I...</i>

00:22:02.240 --> 00:22:05.170
<i>Neither of us could ever 
be like Higashira Isana.</i>
